{
  "inShort": "The checkpoint is at risk: the artifacts show preparation, not a playable slice. Four supporting tasks closed, but the trailer storyboard has no evidence yet. The main risk is that neither the claimed tide loop nor co-op sailing can be checked from what was shown.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvuoyivb01awtvz8v6fyg2xh",
      "text": "The public Godot demo repository matches the task. It supplies reusable examples, not evidence that the game's tide or sailing works."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvuoyj2j01axtvz8lc3mdzjj",
      "text": "The animated reference video closes the task. Its title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny, but the video was not watched. Its animation and usefulness as an art-style reference remain unverified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvuoyj5x01aytvz8lsr5pz2m",
      "text": "The reference article matches the task and explains playtesting methods. It supports test preparation, but does not show that five players tested the game."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvuoyj7c01aztvz8t0jcex56",
      "text": "The design-board artifact closes the task. Its contents were not inspected, so it does not establish a chosen style."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [
    "cmvuoyj7w01b0tvz86u0a9ezv"
  ],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports a tide flooding and draining one island, plus two-player boat crewing. Those claims address the goal directly, but the mountain photograph and film thumbnail show neither feature. No playable build was supplied."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "What openable evidence supports the tide loop and two-player sailing claims?",
    "Which tasks cover the second island and tests with five players?",
    "Has the team chosen a visual style, or only collected a reference?"
  ],
  "lenses": {
    "marketing": "“Sprint 1: the tide floods and drains one island; two players can crew the boat” received 0 applause and 0 views; no store page or game link is listed.",
    "team": "The stated hours cover 40–60 hours over 28 days; Mia's engineering hours are additional but unknown. Both confirmed work, and Mia adds capacity for the tide and co-op tasks, but one sprint cannot establish pace.",
    "management": "Four of five tasks closed, but none requires the playable slice or five-player test promised within 28 days. The public devlog covers the stage's publication requirement; the artifacts do not yet establish a working core or chosen style on the path toward release."
  }
}

